 class=\"h2\">Steps worth <em>automating.</em></h2></div></div><div class=\"flow\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Pre-issue checks</h3><p>Model QA checks run the same way before every issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Coordination reports</h3><p>Clash and progress summaries prepared for each meeting.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">File preparation</h3><p>Exports, purges and naming applied before upload to the CDE.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Data exchange</h3><p>Model data moved to and from spreadsheets and other systems.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap wf\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Related</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Related <em>pages.</em></h2></div><ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/digital-engineering/bim-automation/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Automation</b><span>Digital Engineering</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-qa-qc/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM QA/QC</b><span>Assurance</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-coordination/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Coordination</b><span>Coordination</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/dxb-dusk-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/dxb-dusk.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/dxb-dusk.jpg\" alt=\"Dubai skyline at dusk across the water\" loading=\"lazy\">    <p class=\"lab\">Next step</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Your next project deserves <em>more than manpower.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/request-talent/\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"tel:+971588672901\">+971 58 867 2901</a></div>"}